1
00:00:09,277 --> 00:00:11,927
=The Glory Fades 2=

2
00:00:11,927 --> 00:00:13,798
=Episode 10=

3
00:00:18,575 --> 00:00:20,216
Memorize these.

4
00:00:22,113 --> 00:00:23,286
(Smoke Clears, Night of Terror)

5
00:00:23,696 --> 00:00:24,975
(The scar on your arm)

6
00:00:24,975 --> 00:00:28,135
must be from
a severe blood-heat fever, right?

7
00:00:28,656 --> 00:00:30,016
People who've had it

8
00:00:30,255 --> 00:00:31,735
suffer persistent fevers

9
00:00:32,135 --> 00:00:33,135
and skin ulcers.

10
00:00:33,135 --> 00:00:34,176
Even after recovering,

11
00:00:34,415 --> 00:00:36,176
they're left with scars just like yours.

12
00:00:45,415 --> 00:00:46,455
The major outbreak

13
00:00:46,656 --> 00:00:48,175
of this disease

14
00:00:48,296 --> 00:00:49,376
occurred 12 years ago

15
00:00:49,376 --> 00:00:51,775
in a place called Yuge Village.

16
00:00:52,415 --> 00:00:53,855
You didn't catch it there, did you?

17
00:00:57,016 --> 00:00:58,455
What's your zodiac sign?

18
00:01:03,535 --> 00:01:04,535
Type A blood.

19
00:01:05,855 --> 00:01:06,855
See you around.

20
00:01:11,775 --> 00:01:12,896
His name is Tu Jiasheng.

21
00:01:14,816 --> 00:01:16,015
Handsome guy.

22
00:01:16,536 --> 00:01:18,176
He's no ordinary man.

23
00:01:20,056 --> 00:01:21,056
Interesting.

24
00:01:22,336 --> 00:01:25,575
Anyway, everyone's after your secret.

25
00:01:25,736 --> 00:01:27,176
How long are you going to hide it?

26
00:01:27,976 --> 00:01:29,336
Until the end of time.

27
00:01:31,015 --> 00:01:32,295
What happens when you die?

28
00:01:34,176 --> 00:01:35,375
You won't even tell me?

29
00:01:36,855 --> 00:01:38,135
Didn't I tell you?

30
00:01:38,976 --> 00:01:39,976
There are things

31
00:01:40,256 --> 00:01:41,775
you're better off not knowing.

32
00:01:55,816 --> 00:01:56,816
Thank you.

33
00:02:04,680 --> 00:02:05,680
(Confidential
Suspect Supplementary Record)

34
00:02:12,215 --> 00:02:13,215
News from Jiasheng?

35
00:02:13,976 --> 00:02:15,295
If you feel bad about it,

36
00:02:15,295 --> 00:02:17,896
- do me another favor.
- What is it?

37
00:02:17,896 --> 00:02:19,296
Visit Prosperity for me.

38
00:02:19,375 --> 00:02:21,095
You want to bring people over?

39
00:02:21,215 --> 00:02:22,215
Tell Su Yunian

40
00:02:22,255 --> 00:02:23,255
it's purely voluntary.

41
00:02:23,336 --> 00:02:24,535
Anyone willing to come

42
00:02:24,535 --> 00:02:27,736
- won't ever be mistreated here.
- Okay.

43
00:02:27,736 --> 00:02:29,616
He already
gained a foothold in Sea Breeze?

44
00:02:30,896 --> 00:02:32,815
And he's recreating Prosperity in there.

45
00:02:35,655 --> 00:02:36,815
Classic Jiasheng.

46
00:02:39,016 --> 00:02:40,576
But who should go?

47
00:02:41,056 --> 00:02:42,535
Sea Breeze is a prison, after all.

48
00:02:54,535 --> 00:02:55,535
Ms. Bai,

49
00:02:55,616 --> 00:02:56,616
we'll go anywhere

50
00:02:56,655 --> 00:02:57,775
as long as we can leave.

51
00:02:57,975 --> 00:02:59,016
Yeah, Ms. Bai.

52
00:02:59,336 --> 00:03:01,896
We know Jiasheng will treat us right.

53
00:03:01,896 --> 00:03:02,896
Ms. Bai.

54
00:03:08,775 --> 00:03:09,975
Pack your things

55
00:03:10,616 --> 00:03:11,736
and come with me now.

56
00:03:13,136 --> 00:03:14,136
Okay.

57
00:03:20,375 --> 00:03:21,375
Stop right there.

58
00:03:22,655 --> 00:03:23,655
Where are you going?

59
00:03:32,095 --> 00:03:33,296
We work for Feng.

60
00:03:33,856 --> 00:03:35,456
I doubt you have the guts to shoot.

61
00:03:56,375 --> 00:03:57,375
I leave them to you.

62
00:03:57,375 --> 00:03:58,416
Take care of Jiasheng.

63
00:03:58,495 --> 00:03:59,495
Rest assured.

64
00:04:08,815 --> 00:04:09,815
- Jiasheng.
- Jiasheng.

65
00:04:14,416 --> 00:04:15,416
Captain Xia.

66
00:04:15,616 --> 00:04:17,535
Thank you for your hard work.

67
00:04:17,935 --> 00:04:19,056
I'll get back to work.

68
00:04:22,815 --> 00:04:24,336
I know you've suffered lately.

69
00:04:24,336 --> 00:04:25,616
This place may not be so fancy,

70
00:04:26,015 --> 00:04:27,656
but no one can mess with you here.

71
00:04:29,135 --> 00:04:30,135
Shui.

72
00:04:30,815 --> 00:04:31,815
Find a room

73
00:04:31,895 --> 00:04:32,895
and get them settled.

74
00:04:33,135 --> 00:04:34,375
Got it. I'll take care of it.

75
00:04:34,575 --> 00:04:35,575
Come with me.

76
00:04:45,695 --> 00:04:47,255
Jiasheng, I have something for you.

77
00:04:49,455 --> 00:04:50,935
Su Yunian asked me to bring these.

78
00:04:54,495 --> 00:04:56,216
I'll let you carry on.

79
00:05:03,696 --> 00:05:05,466
(File)

80
00:05:07,063 --> 00:05:10,194
(Confidential
Suspect Supplementary Record)

81
00:05:11,335 --> 00:05:13,296
(Voluntarily assigned to Sea Breeze.)

82
00:05:13,575 --> 00:05:16,656
(Abandoned at Tianbei Orphanage
at age 12.)

83
00:05:16,935 --> 00:05:20,216
(Traumatic amnesia
limited to childhood only.)

84
00:05:20,335 --> 00:05:23,015
(Adult memory, logic,
and cognition fully intact.)

85
00:05:30,335 --> 00:05:32,135
As expected

86
00:05:33,096 --> 00:05:34,536
of Prosperity's finest.

87
00:05:35,015 --> 00:05:36,976
Gorgeous and elegant.

88
00:05:37,495 --> 00:05:38,656
We're flattered, Warden.

89
00:05:38,815 --> 00:05:40,255
Please take care of us.

90
00:05:40,536 --> 00:05:41,656
Sweet-talking, too.

91
00:05:42,935 --> 00:05:43,935
Tu Jiasheng,

92
00:05:44,495 --> 00:05:45,656
you are truly

93
00:05:45,976 --> 00:05:46,976
efficient.

94
00:05:48,335 --> 00:05:49,335
Speaking of which,

95
00:05:49,976 --> 00:05:51,135
Captain Xia used to

96
00:05:51,416 --> 00:05:53,455
oppose this business the most.

97
00:05:54,015 --> 00:05:55,495
You've finally come around to it.

98
00:05:56,335 --> 00:05:57,536
Is that thanks to

99
00:05:59,135 --> 00:06:00,776
your guidance, Tu Jiasheng?

100
00:06:03,216 --> 00:06:04,216
Warden Tang,

101
00:06:04,416 --> 00:06:06,056
you've been working hard
running Sea Breeze.

102
00:06:06,056 --> 00:06:07,656
Want me to pick one for you

103
00:06:07,935 --> 00:06:08,935
to help you relax?

104
00:06:13,815 --> 00:06:16,296
Now that you've mentioned it,
I am a bit tempted.

105
00:06:17,695 --> 00:06:19,976
Still, business is business.

106
00:06:20,736 --> 00:06:22,255
Guests come first.

107
00:06:23,135 --> 00:06:24,815
The first client
has made an appointment.

108
00:06:25,416 --> 00:06:26,695
- Welcome, Mr. Chen.
- Welcome, Mr. Chen.

109
00:06:29,335 --> 00:06:30,375
Come on.

110
00:06:30,455 --> 00:06:31,455
Four lovely ladies.

111
00:06:31,856 --> 00:06:33,575
Let me get a close look at you.

112
00:06:36,416 --> 00:06:37,416
On your knees.

113
00:06:37,536 --> 00:06:38,695
Crawl over to me.

114
00:06:39,616 --> 00:06:40,616
Mr. Chen,

115
00:06:40,616 --> 00:06:42,776
I'm sorry,
but we don't offer that kind of service.

116
00:06:42,776 --> 00:06:44,056
Then what do you offer?

117
00:06:44,135 --> 00:06:45,416
We can keep you company,

118
00:06:45,656 --> 00:06:46,656
drink wine

119
00:06:46,895 --> 00:06:48,695
or tea with you, and sing with you.

120
00:06:48,976 --> 00:06:50,135
If you want,

121
00:06:50,255 --> 00:06:51,895
we can also give you a massage.

122
00:06:52,375 --> 00:06:54,335
- And then?
- That's all.

123
00:06:54,375 --> 00:06:55,375
That's all?

124
00:06:58,575 --> 00:07:00,455
I paid a fortune for this.

125
00:07:01,616 --> 00:07:03,776
I'll have fun however I want.

126
00:07:05,015 --> 00:07:06,015
Got it?

127
00:07:06,495 --> 00:07:07,495
Jiasheng.

128
00:07:12,736 --> 00:07:14,495
So you love kneeling service, Mr. Chen?

129
00:07:14,656 --> 00:07:15,656
Yeah.

130
00:07:15,695 --> 00:07:16,695
That's my thing.

131
00:07:16,935 --> 00:07:17,935
Fine.

132
00:07:18,455 --> 00:07:19,695
I'll grant your wish.

133
00:07:27,416 --> 00:07:29,656
- Looking forward to serving you again.
- Looking forward to serving you again.

134
00:07:33,976 --> 00:07:35,176
I don't care who you are.

135
00:07:35,416 --> 00:07:36,616
On my turf,

136
00:07:36,976 --> 00:07:38,575
you play by my rules.

137
00:07:39,176 --> 00:07:40,375
Follow them,

138
00:07:40,455 --> 00:07:42,335
or get lost.

139
00:07:56,736 --> 00:07:58,335
You just threw him out like that?

140
00:07:58,976 --> 00:07:59,976
As I said,

141
00:08:00,176 --> 00:08:01,416
I set the rules here.

142
00:08:01,736 --> 00:08:03,015
What if Tang Zhen asks about it?

143
00:08:03,176 --> 00:08:04,296
Some pathetic people

144
00:08:04,736 --> 00:08:05,736
would give everything

145
00:08:05,815 --> 00:08:07,296
for something they can't get.

146
00:08:08,135 --> 00:08:09,255
Tang Zhen will understand.

147
00:08:09,815 --> 00:08:10,976
Old Ghost knows the deal.

148
00:08:11,176 --> 00:08:12,255
He holds his secret,

149
00:08:12,856 --> 00:08:14,135
and nobody dares touch him.

150
00:08:14,656 --> 00:08:15,656
And they look after him.

151
00:08:18,495 --> 00:08:19,736
I'm going to see Old Ghost.

152
00:08:20,096 --> 00:08:21,135
Make yourself at home.

153
00:08:22,096 --> 00:08:23,135
Just returning a favor.

154
00:08:23,216 --> 00:08:24,216
Relax.

155
00:08:30,176 --> 00:08:31,176
Wan.

156
00:08:32,176 --> 00:08:33,176
Come sit.

157
00:08:39,736 --> 00:08:41,215
Why are you in this line of work?

158
00:08:42,296 --> 00:08:44,176
To make a live. What else could it be?

159
00:08:44,896 --> 00:08:46,256
My family had heavy debts.

160
00:08:46,695 --> 00:08:48,496
Prosperity paid well, so I took the job.

161
00:08:48,496 --> 00:08:49,575
Was it always like this

162
00:08:49,735 --> 00:08:50,935
at Prosperity?

163
00:08:51,016 --> 00:08:52,256
Back then,

164
00:08:52,575 --> 00:08:53,656
the girls had to pass

165
00:08:53,656 --> 00:08:54,776
strict interviews.

166
00:08:54,896 --> 00:08:56,095
Training lasted three months.

167
00:08:56,815 --> 00:08:58,855
We learned tea ceremony,
floral arrangement,

168
00:08:58,855 --> 00:09:00,776
wine tasting, and conversation skills.

169
00:09:00,975 --> 00:09:01,975
Jiasheng said

170
00:09:02,016 --> 00:09:03,455
Prosperity runs a classy business.

171
00:09:03,496 --> 00:09:04,935
It's not some dirty place.

172
00:09:16,095 --> 00:09:17,095
Uncle Ghost.

173
00:09:21,016 --> 00:09:22,176
What's this?

174
00:09:25,735 --> 00:09:27,376
People who've had blood-heat fever

175
00:09:27,776 --> 00:09:29,215
suffer from severe chronic aftereffects.

176
00:09:29,536 --> 00:09:30,776
Chronic chest tightness

177
00:09:31,095 --> 00:09:32,256
and aching joints all over.

178
00:09:32,416 --> 00:09:33,935
Try this prescription

179
00:09:34,296 --> 00:09:35,296
from a renowned doctor.

180
00:09:35,455 --> 00:09:36,855
It's said to work wonders.

181
00:09:37,575 --> 00:09:38,776
You know traditional medicine?

182
00:09:40,215 --> 00:09:41,256
Try it out.

183
00:09:41,455 --> 00:09:42,536
If it works well,

184
00:09:42,735 --> 00:09:43,855
I can keep you supplied.

185
00:10:01,935 --> 00:10:02,935
(The file says)

186
00:10:03,136 --> 00:10:05,735
he killed his ex-girlfriend An Ruoxi.
Is that true?

187
00:10:05,735 --> 00:10:06,735
No way.

188
00:10:06,975 --> 00:10:08,256
He would never do that.

189
00:10:08,496 --> 00:10:10,335
He's been searching for the real killer.

190
00:10:10,536 --> 00:10:11,735
Nie Feng fabricated it

191
00:10:11,735 --> 00:10:12,975
just to frame him.

192
00:10:16,095 --> 00:10:17,095
Captain Xia,

193
00:10:17,815 --> 00:10:18,855
you seem

194
00:10:19,095 --> 00:10:20,735
to care a lot about Jiasheng.

195
00:10:23,615 --> 00:10:25,536
Not really, just making small talk.

196
00:10:25,935 --> 00:10:27,136
I have to go.

197
00:10:34,416 --> 00:10:35,416
Jiasheng.

198
00:10:43,896 --> 00:10:46,935
Your Highness, Tu Jiasheng
has entered the Sea Breeze villa area

199
00:10:47,176 --> 00:10:48,335
and made contact with Old Ghost.

200
00:10:49,095 --> 00:10:50,335
That was fast.

201
00:10:51,056 --> 00:10:52,335
Keep watching him.

202
00:10:53,735 --> 00:10:55,896
And keep an eye on Nie Feng.

203
00:10:56,575 --> 00:10:57,656
Alright, Director Wang.

204
00:10:57,935 --> 00:11:00,215
I'll leave the votes
from the southern states to you.

205
00:11:02,095 --> 00:11:03,536
Next time you visit Prosperity,

206
00:11:03,656 --> 00:11:05,536
I'll make sure
you're well taken care of.

207
00:11:06,416 --> 00:11:08,215
All right, I won't keep you.

208
00:11:08,776 --> 00:11:09,776
Bye.

209
00:11:16,455 --> 00:11:17,656
What did you just say?

210
00:11:18,656 --> 00:11:20,455
A female guard from Sea Breeze

211
00:11:21,016 --> 00:11:23,095
took Yu Yingwan and the others away?

212
00:11:23,896 --> 00:11:24,896
Yeah.

213
00:11:25,496 --> 00:11:27,376
Yeah, her name is Xia Yuyan.

214
00:11:27,416 --> 00:11:29,136
Feng, I've asked around.

215
00:11:29,256 --> 00:11:30,296
Phachai is dead.

216
00:11:30,416 --> 00:11:31,575
Now someone named Lion

217
00:11:31,575 --> 00:11:32,735
runs the tobacco and booze business.

218
00:11:33,416 --> 00:11:34,935
And Tu Jiasheng runs the girls

219
00:11:35,575 --> 00:11:36,695
at the villa.

220
00:11:38,256 --> 00:11:39,656
Jiasheng

221
00:11:40,095 --> 00:11:41,695
is quite something.

222
00:11:42,335 --> 00:11:44,256
I only took my eyes off him
for a few days,

223
00:11:45,016 --> 00:11:47,335
and he's already back on his feet.

224
00:11:53,215 --> 00:11:54,215
Hello?

225
00:11:54,256 --> 00:11:55,256
Tang,

226
00:11:55,776 --> 00:11:57,855
can you run Sea Breeze or not?

227
00:11:58,056 --> 00:12:00,176
I sent several groups

228
00:12:00,176 --> 00:12:01,496
to deal with Tu Jiasheng,

229
00:12:02,296 --> 00:12:04,296
but Xia Yuyan
ruined every single attempt.

230
00:12:04,656 --> 00:12:05,935
She was also the one

231
00:12:05,935 --> 00:12:07,695
who arranged his villa stay.

232
00:12:08,215 --> 00:12:09,735
They've been very close lately.

233
00:12:09,975 --> 00:12:11,935
I suspect she's already

234
00:12:12,496 --> 00:12:13,855
working for him.

235
00:12:15,536 --> 00:12:16,615
Xia Yuyan.

236
00:12:17,335 --> 00:12:18,536
My hands are tied here.

237
00:12:19,056 --> 00:12:21,095
She has backing
from the Central Government.

238
00:12:21,575 --> 00:12:24,136
So if Xia Yuyan were gone,

239
00:12:25,215 --> 00:12:27,855
you'd be free to crush Tu Jiasheng?

240
00:12:28,735 --> 00:12:30,695
Absolutely, Mr. Nie.

241
00:12:30,735 --> 00:12:32,496
Once Xia Yuyan falls,

242
00:12:33,215 --> 00:12:34,815
Tu Jiasheng will lose his shield.

243
00:12:34,815 --> 00:12:36,176
Then I can tear him apart

244
00:12:36,176 --> 00:12:37,176
any way I want.

245
00:12:37,296 --> 00:12:38,296
I see.

246
00:12:43,215 --> 00:12:44,735
Sly old fox.

247
00:12:48,776 --> 00:12:49,776
Feng,

248
00:12:50,095 --> 00:12:51,095
if you ask me,

249
00:12:52,896 --> 00:12:55,136
we should
just have Xia Yuyan transferred.

250
00:12:55,975 --> 00:12:57,256
What else can she do then?

251
00:12:57,536 --> 00:12:59,416
Xu from the Central Inspection Ministry

252
00:13:00,016 --> 00:13:01,855
has always been at odds with us.

253
00:13:02,455 --> 00:13:03,776
Xia Yuyan

254
00:13:04,776 --> 00:13:07,935
is a pawn he planted in Sea Breeze.

255
00:13:08,855 --> 00:13:10,416
She won't be easy to transfer.

256
00:13:10,455 --> 00:13:11,815
So we just let Tu Jiasheng

257
00:13:12,016 --> 00:13:14,016
run wild in Sea Breeze?

258
00:13:14,016 --> 00:13:15,496
That's too easy for him.

259
00:13:15,815 --> 00:13:17,735
I can't take it, even if you can.

260
00:13:23,575 --> 00:13:24,575
Feng.

261
00:13:27,335 --> 00:13:28,335
Du Qiang.

262
00:13:28,575 --> 00:13:29,735
Go pick someone up

263
00:13:30,855 --> 00:13:31,855
from Sea Breeze.

264
00:13:54,192 --> 00:13:57,808
♪Streetlights stretch shadows long♪

265
00:13:58,178 --> 00:14:02,163
♪As crowds fade,
who lingers on the edge♪

266
00:14:06,919 --> 00:14:10,238
♪Guarding all those unfinished lies♪

267
00:14:10,238 --> 00:14:15,323
♪Wind sweeps through the empty harbor♪

268
00:14:18,912 --> 00:14:25,464
♪Time quietly strips away the madness♪

269
00:14:25,464 --> 00:14:33,885
♪Plunging all passion
into freezing cold♪

270
00:14:33,885 --> 00:14:37,114
♪The feast ends, leaving only emptiness♪

271
00:14:37,114 --> 00:14:40,309
♪The past drifts far away, unstoppable♪

272
00:14:40,309 --> 00:14:43,002
♪If regret is an inescapable wandering♪

273
00:14:43,002 --> 00:14:47,619
♪I swallow the silence, burning alone♪

274
00:14:51,530 --> 00:14:54,019
♪Burning alone♪

275
00:14:59,525 --> 00:15:05,894
♪The glory fades♪
